WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: lg

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Mwasuze mutya, eno ye Manner Code.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.350
Sofutiweya nzibu nnyo

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.890
Okusookera ddala, waliwo code nnyingi ezeetaaga okuwandiikibwa.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.710
Just the example projects ze natondawo ku series eno

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.270
Koodi eno eweza layini ezisukka mu 12,000.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.320
Bwe kiba nga mpeereza yennyini ekola

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.530
Ne bwe kiba nga kya mpeereza ntono, kyangu okusukka layini 100,000.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.300
Ennyiriri emitwalo kikumi zimala okujjuza ebitabo amakumi abiri.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.560
Okuwandiika code empanvu tekitegeeza nti ewedde.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.540
Olina okusigala ng’otereeza koodi gy’owandiika.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.800
Bw’otereeza A, B ekutukako.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.130
Bw’otereeza B, A ne C zijja kumenya.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.260
Okukozesa okugeraageranya, kiringa okusibira mu Rasputa n’okaaba.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.360
Oyinza okugamba nti embeera efaananako n’embalaasi.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.550
Mu kiseera kino, ojja kuwulira obwetaavu bw’okukola dizayini.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.010
Naye mu butuufu bw’ogezaako okuwandiika ekiwandiiko kya dizayini, .

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.490
Okwolesa ebirowoozo mu mutwe gwo mu ngeri entuufu

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.260
Ojja kukizuula nti si kyangu nga bw’olowooza.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:05.600
Ne sheet music, nga kino kiwandiiko ekikwata amaloboozi oba ennyimba mu ngeri ey’okulaba, .

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.700
Kino kizibu nnyo

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.610
Si muziki gwokka, wabula n’ebyensimbi n’okutambuza ebintu

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:14.060
Endowooza ez’enjawulo ennyo n’ebyetaago by’abakozesa ebitaliimu

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:17.220
Tekijja kuba kyangu kukiraga mu modeli eyeetongodde.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.490
Eby'obulungi

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:23.200
Okuvvuunuka obuzibu bw’okukola modeling abstract concepts

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.860
UML yazaalibwa ku nkomerero y’emyaka gya 1990.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.120
Yakulembeddwamu Grady Butch.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.390
Tukozesa UML nga tusuubira

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.990
Kuba ekifaananyi kya kiraasi

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.760
Ka tugende n’ekifaananyi ky’omutendera

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:39.980
naye

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.160
Mu butuufu bwe nagezaako okugikola dizayini, yali ya njawulo ku kugikolako enkoodi butereevu.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.130
Kirabika tekirina njawulo nnyo

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:46.520
Lwaki bwe kityo bwe kiri?

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.910
Ekyo kiri bwe kityo kubanga enkola y’ebirowoozo emanyidde okussa mu nkola.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.170
Mu kifo ky’okufuula endowooza ezitaliimu (abstract concepts) okubeera entuufu, .

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.590
Kubanga kivvuunula endowooza y’omutendera gw’okussa mu nkola mu UML.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.270
Olw’okuba osobola okusoma sheet music

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.950
Si nga bwe nsobola okugiyiiya

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.850
Just because wayiga UML

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.170
Si nga bw’okulaakulanya obukugu mu kukola dizayini.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.300
Kale mu lunyiriri luno

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.580
Nga bayita mu pulojekiti entuufu

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.420
Engeri y'okufuula ebyetaago ebitaliimu (abstract requirements).

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.290
Osobola okuyunga koodi?

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.010
Njagala okukulaga mu buntu

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.930
Nasalawo okutereka tikiti za firimu okusinziira ku domain

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.200
Okuteeka tikiti za firimu kyangu okutegeera kubanga okusinga domains ezimanyiddwa.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.710
Mulimu emirimu egy’enjawulo nga okuyingira, okusasula, n’okulonda ebifo.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.580
Kirabika ng’ekyokulabirako ekirungi

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.890
Okusinga, omulamwa gw’ekiwandiiko kino gwe gwa software design, naye

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.350
Tugenda kukwata ku nkulaakulana evugirwa n’okugezesa.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.890
Embeera z’enkulaakulana ez’omulembe mu butonde ziwagira ebikozesebwa mu kugezesa.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.320
Ne bw’otunuulira pulojekiti ezimanyiddwa ennyo ez’enkozesa enzigule, .

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:51.130
Tulina omutindo ogugere ogw’okugezesa.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:56.200
Kino kirabika kitegeeza nti okugezesa kukulu nnyo era kwa mugaso nnyo.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.120
Naye mu butuufu

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.590
Mu mbeera nnyingi, si TDD yokka, naye ne test automation teteekebwa mu nkola bulungi.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.260
Okusooka okuwandiika ebigezo eby’amakulu nga tolina kwetegeka kwonna kwe...

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.540
Si kyangu n’akatono

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:12.340
Kino kintu ekyetaagisa obusobozi obugatta obw’okukola pulogulaamu za kompyuta.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.270
Kale, kirungi okukola ku dizayini ne TDD wamu.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.180
Nasalawo nti ekola bulungi

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.450
Kale kati ka tutandike olukiiko olusooka olwa pulojekiti.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.470
Kubanga eno pulojekiti ntono

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.090
Abagenda okubeerawo mulimu babiri

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.340
Oyo ali ku kkono mukugu mu domain, ate ali ku ddyo ye developer.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:37.790
Abakugu mu domain balina kye boogera ku nkola ze twetaaga okuzimba.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.280
Kinyumya emboozi nnyingi

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.160
Katemba gwe tuddukanya

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.710
Ziri mu nkumi nnya okwetoloola eggwanga.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.220
Kiyinza okwongera okweyongera mu biseera eby’omu maaso.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.480
Mu kiseera kino, omulimu gw’okuteeka tikiti za firimu gwokka gwe guwagirwa.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.510
Tuteekateeka okwongerako okutunda tikiti z’ebivvulu ebinene oluvannyuma.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.940
Era ekikulu nti tolina kuddamu kukuba bifo bikubisaamu emirundi ebiri.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:03.250
Edda ebifo ebiweereza bakasitoma byali bizibu nnyo n’ekizibu eky’ekika ekyo.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.670
Kubanga waliwo amawulire mangi agakwata ku firimu n’okuddamu okwetegereza data eyakunganyizibwa edda.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:11.090
Data zino zirina okusigala nga bwe ziri.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.730
Wano emboozi etegekeddwa bulungi, naye

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.960
Mu butuufu, waliwo amawulire amalala

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.600
Kijja kutuusibwa mu ngeri etategekeddwa bulungi

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.110
Naye emboozi efuluma ku ntandikwa ya pulojekiti eri...

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.780
