00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
Tekinnamanyika kiki ky'okola

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Wano ne wano bwe kityo bwe kiri

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
Ddala kiddukanyizibwa kitya?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Simanyi

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Nga twogera n’abakugu mu by’amasimu

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Buli kintu ky’okuddukanya kigaziyiziddwa okutuuka ku mbeera y’enkozesa eyeetongodde.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Bwe kiba nga pulojekiti ya ddala

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
Oboolyawo waliwo ensonga z’okukozesa ezisinga ku zino.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Wano nnyanguyizza okunnyonnyola.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Ekikulu okwetegereza wano kiri nti bw’okola obudde bw’okudduka, .

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
Olaba nga tikiti nayo yatondebwa

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Era ng’ogula oba ng’ozzaayo tikiti

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
Era osobola okulaba nti tukozesa empeereza ey’ebweru eyitibwa payment gateway.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Nagatta enkozesa ya bakasitoma ne ba maneja.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Okutunuulira use case yonna bweti

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Ekintu kiwulira nga kyerere

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Waliwo eky’okulondako okwongerako katemba

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Siraba kintu kyonna nga Search Theater

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
Kirabika waliwo enkozesa ntono nnyo ezilekebwawo.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Kubanga okusinziira ku ndowooza y’omukugu mu domain, waliwo bingi eby’okunnyonnyola.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Ensonga eno ey’okukozesa, erabika nga yeeyoleka nnyo, .

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Osobola okulekawo ennyinnyonnyola

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
Kale ate okusinziira ku ndowooza y’omukugu mu kukola ebintu?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
Kirungi okulekawo emisango gy’amawulire egyangu ng’okunoonya katemba.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Kino tekyandiyambye nnyo mu kuddukanya ebiwandiiko?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Bwe kiba nga kya backend design

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Enkozesa ennyangu nga okunoonya katemba

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Ndowooza nti si kibi okukibuuka

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Kye njogera kiri nti tekikeeredde kwanukula mu kiseera ky’okussa mu nkola.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Naye bwe kiba nga pulojekiti ya ddala

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Ku bateekateeka screen, ensonga zino ez’okukozesa ntandikwa nnungi.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Omutegesi yatunuulira enkozesa y’okunoonya katemba.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Nsobozese ntya okunoonya ebifo ebisanyukirwamu?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
Ojja kusobola okulowooza

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Bw’ogatta ebifaananyi mu kimu, kirabika nga kizibu.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Singa yali pulojekiti ya ddala, yandibadde nzibu nnyo.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
Mu mbeera eno, tekyetaagisa kukaka kugatta.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Nze naakazigatta wano okulaga nti waliwo emisango egibula.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Najjuzaamu emisango gyonna egyabuze

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Nnina use case nga connection ne actor erekeddwawo.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Kino kikwata ku bakasitoma ne ba maneja.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Era okusobola okwanguyirwa okussa mu nkola, nakiwandiika mu Lungereza.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Kati si kibi kubanga pulojekiti ntono

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Singa pulojekiti eba nnene era nga nzibu

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
Omukugu mu domain yanditandikidde wa okunnyonnyola?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Kiyinza okuba ekizibu

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Omuddukanya emirimu akola ki?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Omulimu munene nnyo

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Nga bwekisuubirwa okuva eri maneja

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
Mu mbeera eno, tusobola okugabanyaamu bannakatemba?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Era kirungi okwekenneenya

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Mu kusooka nnayitibwa administrator

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
Kiyinza okusoboka okugabanyaamu okusinziira ku mirimu

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
Era nga tukozesa Enkola ya Movie Booking System

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Wayinza okubaawo empeereza ez’ebweru

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Singa tugabanya bannakatemba bwe tuti,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Abakugu mu domain bajja kusobola okuwa amawulire agasingawo entegeke.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
Kya lwatu nti kino kyakulabirako kimu kyokka eky’okwekenneenya ekitundu ekizibu.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Wayinza okubaawo engeri endala ennungi

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Kikulu okuddamu mu ngeri ekyukakyuka okusinziira ku mbeera.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Kino kye kifundikwa

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Ku mulundi guno, tujja kukozesa ekifaananyi ky’embeera y’okukozesa

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Teekawo ebiruubirirwa bya pulojekiti eyo

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Nze mpise mu mitendera egyasooka egy’okwekenneenya.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Nze ku lwange, mu nkola yonna ey’enkulaakulana

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Ndowooza okwekenneenya kwe kusinga okukaluba

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Kubanga tulina okusengeka endowooza ezisinga okubeera ez’obutafaayo era ezitaliimu makulu.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Omulundi oguddako tujja kutunuulira ensonga enkulu ezikozesebwa

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Ka twekenneenye mu bujjuvu

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Mwebale nnyo okukola ennyo okutuusa kati.

